<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.160" end="00:00:04.400" style="s2">Please welcome to the stage the Attorney</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.240" end="00:00:07.400" style="s2">General of the United States, Todd</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:07.400" style="s2">Blanch.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.480" end="00:00:12.500" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.839" end="00:00:19.080" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.119" end="00:00:23.199" style="s2">Thank you. Good afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.680" end="00:00:25.920" style="s2">Welcome to the Department of Justice.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.199" end="00:00:28.240" style="s2">And I want to be the first to welcome uh</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.920" end="00:00:30.240" style="s2">President Trump to his second trip back</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.240" end="00:00:32.079" style="s2">to the Department of Justice as a 47th</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.240" end="00:00:34.800" style="s2">President of the United States. We are</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.079" end="00:00:37.040" style="s2">honored, humbled, and thrilled to have</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.800" end="00:00:39.200" style="s2">you join us today, Mr. President. And on</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.040" end="00:00:41.440" style="s2">behalf of the prosecutors in the room,</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.200" end="00:00:44.399" style="s2">the law enforcement members in the room,</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.440" end="00:00:46.399" style="s2">and everybody that&#39;s here today, let me</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.399" end="00:00:48.960" style="s2">just tell you that we are here. We are</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.399" end="00:00:50.800" style="s2">so appreciative that President Trump</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.960" end="00:00:53.360" style="s2">delivered on his promise to the American</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.800" end="00:00:55.120" style="s2">people that when he took office again</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.360" end="00:00:58.000" style="s2">that he would do everything in his power</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.120" end="00:01:01.520" style="s2">to unleash law enforcement to do their</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.000" end="00:01:03.199" style="s2">jobs to keep this country safe again,</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.520" end="00:01:05.920" style="s2">which is exactly what he&#39;s done. So,</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.199" end="00:01:09.240" style="s2">thank you, Mr. President. We&#39;re also on</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.920" end="00:01:09.240" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.280" end="00:01:15.200" style="s2">We&#39;re also honored to welcome some of</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.479" end="00:01:17.119" style="s2">the families of the victims whose lives</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.200" end="00:01:20.880" style="s2">were forever changed by the vicious</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.119" end="00:01:23.520" style="s2">behavior of the death row inmates whose</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.880" end="00:01:26.240" style="s2">sentences have now been commuted by</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.520" end="00:01:29.040" style="s2">Governor Nuome. Thank you very much for</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.240" end="00:01:33.840" style="s2">being here today and thank you for</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.040" end="00:01:36.079" style="s2">speaking up. Mr. President, on day one,</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.840" end="00:01:38.240" style="s2">on day one of your presidency, you</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.079" end="00:01:40.400" style="s2">issued an executive order that directed</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.240" end="00:01:43.840" style="s2">the Department of Justice to seek the</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.400" end="00:01:46.640" style="s2">death penalty wherever appropriate.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.840" end="00:01:49.920" style="s2">Since January 20th of last year, the</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.640" end="00:01:53.280" style="s2">Department of Justice has done so 49</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.920" end="00:01:55.520" style="s2">times. Now, when you compare that to the</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.280" end="00:01:57.680" style="s2">last administration, during the last</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.520" end="00:02:00.240" style="s2">administration, the Department of</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.680" end="00:02:02.079" style="s2">Justice sought the death penalty one</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.240" end="00:02:05.600" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.079" end="00:02:07.680" style="s2">One time. That is not justice. That is</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.600" end="00:02:09.599" style="s2">not what the American people deserve.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.680" end="00:02:12.239" style="s2">That is not what the families of victims</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.599" end="00:02:14.080" style="s2">of horrific murders deserve. And so, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.239" end="00:02:15.599" style="s2">President, I assure you that this</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.080" end="00:02:18.400" style="s2">Department of Justice is seeking the</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.599" end="00:02:21.280" style="s2">death penalty whenever appropriate for</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.400" end="00:02:23.520" style="s2">crimes get committed in this country.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.280" end="00:02:26.239" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.520" end="00:02:28.160" style="s2">I want to take just a moment</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.239" end="00:02:30.720" style="s2">and tell every law enforcement member</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.160" end="00:02:32.879" style="s2">watching or here in this room that we</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.720" end="00:02:34.879" style="s2">have your back, that President Trump has</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.879" end="00:02:38.640" style="s2">your back, and he will always have your</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.879" end="00:02:40.400" style="s2">back. to the families</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.640" end="00:02:43.440" style="s2">to the families of the victims of the</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.400" end="00:02:45.280" style="s2">horrible crimes that have been committed</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.440" end="00:02:48.080" style="s2">not only in California but around this</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.280" end="00:02:50.560" style="s2">country. Make no mistake about it that</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.080" end="00:02:52.480" style="s2">this Department of Justice every single</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.560" end="00:02:55.599" style="s2">day that our prosecutors that our</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.480" end="00:02:58.800" style="s2">federal agents will do everything we can</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.599" end="00:03:01.360" style="s2">to impose the harshest penalty possible</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.800" end="00:03:03.200" style="s2">under the facts of the case consistent</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.360" end="00:03:05.360" style="s2">with the president&#39;s agenda. That&#39;s what</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.200" end="00:03:07.840" style="s2">we have done since January 20th. of what</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.360" end="00:03:12.239" style="s2">we will continue to do from this day</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.840" end="00:03:14.640" style="s2">going forward. So with that, let me be</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.239" end="00:03:18.400" style="s2">um let me just ask everybody to get on</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.640" end="00:03:20.080" style="s2">their feet and welcome the 45th and 47th</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.400" end="00:03:23.052" style="s2">president of the United States,</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.080" end="00:03:25.072" style="s2">President Donald J. Trump.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.052" end="00:03:25.072" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.567" end="00:03:33.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.440" end="00:03:42.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heat. Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.872" end="00:03:53.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.112" end="00:03:59.132" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.697" end="00:04:03.717" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.319" end="00:04:12.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you very much. Please. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.519" end="00:04:16.639" style="s2">It&#39;s a great honor.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.640" end="00:04:20.320" style="s2">I want to just welcome all of you to a</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.639" end="00:04:23.199" style="s2">very safe Washington DC. You know, the</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.320" end="00:04:24.960" style="s2">crime rates gone down 84%</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.199" end="00:04:27.840" style="s2">and a lot of the people in this room are</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.960" end="00:04:31.520" style="s2">responsible for that. And I want to</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.840" end="00:04:33.440" style="s2">thank you to a very special thanks to an</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.520" end="00:04:34.880" style="s2">outstanding attorney general. It&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.440" end="00:04:36.400" style="s2">to be one of the greats. I think he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.880" end="00:04:38.320" style="s2">go down as one of the greats when we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.400" end="00:04:41.720" style="s2">finished. Todd Blanch. Thank you, Todd.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.320" end="00:04:41.720" style="s2">Appreciate it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.840" end="00:04:49.520" style="s2">Where is he? What happened? He&#39;s around.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.880" end="00:04:51.840" style="s2">He&#39;s around here someplace. I can&#39;t I</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.520" end="00:04:55.040" style="s2">want to say hello to Todd. He&#39;s special.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.840" end="00:04:57.120" style="s2">He works all the time. We&#39;re here today</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.040" end="00:05:00.240" style="s2">to talk about one of the most shocking</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.120" end="00:05:01.919" style="s2">acts of injustice our country has ever</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.240" end="00:05:03.600" style="s2">seen. I couldn&#39;t believe it. I witnessed</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.919" end="00:05:06.080" style="s2">it a couple of weeks ago. I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.600" end="00:05:09.199" style="s2">believe it. Just days ago, the governor</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.080" end="00:05:12.800" style="s2">of California, Gavin Nuome, granted</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.199" end="00:05:16.479" style="s2">clemency and mercy to 548 of the most</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.800" end="00:05:19.520" style="s2">evil monsters on the face of the earth.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.479" end="00:05:22.080" style="s2">You&#39;d have to read their biographies to</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.520" end="00:05:23.440" style="s2">see how bad they were. Some of them you</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.080" end="00:05:27.360" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t even believe it. All of them,</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.440" end="00:05:30.560" style="s2">but some of them you would levels of</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.360" end="00:05:32.080" style="s2">craziness, sickness that I&#39;ve never seen</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.560" end="00:05:35.120" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.080" end="00:05:38.800" style="s2">Among those death row inmates he granted</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.120" end="00:05:41.280" style="s2">clemency were more than 110 child</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.800" end="00:05:43.759" style="s2">killers, more than 100 rapists who</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.280" end="00:05:45.440" style="s2">murdered their victims, and numerous</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.759" end="00:05:48.560" style="s2">serial killers who tortured and</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.440" end="00:05:50.400" style="s2">slaughtered dozens of innocent people</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.560" end="00:05:52.000" style="s2">at levels that nobody&#39;s ever seen</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.400" end="00:05:55.759" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.000" end="00:05:58.800" style="s2">Among the serial killers he spared is</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.759" end="00:06:01.039" style="s2">Charles Ing, who tortured, enslaved, and</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.800" end="00:06:03.600" style="s2">slaughtered at least 11 people,</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.039" end="00:06:06.960" style="s2">including babies, in a torture chamber</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.600" end="00:06:10.319" style="s2">in a remote cabin, as well as the</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.960" end="00:06:13.680" style="s2">Southside Slayer who killed 14 women and</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.319" end="00:06:17.280" style="s2">enjoyed every moment of it in an unborn</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.680" end="00:06:19.440" style="s2">child in South Los Angeles.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.280" end="00:06:23.600" style="s2">and the scorecard killer. They call him</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.440" end="00:06:26.080" style="s2">the scorecard killer who kept a tally in</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.600" end="00:06:29.039" style="s2">his car of at least 16 young men he</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.080" end="00:06:31.759" style="s2">abducted, raped and murdered. And the</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.039" end="00:06:34.560" style="s2">alphabet killer was that name, alphabet</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.759" end="00:06:37.520" style="s2">killer, who raped and murdered innocent</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.560" end="00:06:40.240" style="s2">young girls whose first and last name</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.520" end="00:06:43.759" style="s2">started with the same letter. He needed</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.240" end="00:06:45.759" style="s2">that same letter. These are sick people.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.759" end="00:06:48.800" style="s2">This afternoon, we come together to</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.759" end="00:06:50.880" style="s2">stand against the travesty and to wrap</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.800" end="00:06:53.440" style="s2">our arms around the families of victims</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.880" end="00:06:57.199" style="s2">who were so cruy betrayed by bad</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.440" end="00:06:59.520" style="s2">government and our political system. To</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.199" end="00:07:02.880" style="s2">every parent, son, daughter, sibling, or</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.520" end="00:07:06.880" style="s2">spouse here today whose loved one was</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.880" end="00:07:09.440" style="s2">brutally killed by those monsters, we</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.880" end="00:07:13.520" style="s2">love you. We support you and we are with</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.440" end="00:07:16.319" style="s2">you and your quest for un really the the</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.520" end="00:07:18.319" style="s2">ultimate of final justice. We have to do</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.319" end="00:07:20.000" style="s2">this. We can&#39;t let this happen. What</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.319" end="00:07:24.240" style="s2">happened to you, what happened to all of</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.000" end="00:07:27.440" style="s2">us should not be allowed to stand. What</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.240" end="00:07:30.319" style="s2">these families have endured is beyond</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.440" end="00:07:33.199" style="s2">imagination.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.319" end="00:07:35.599" style="s2">One day their lives were shattered into</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.199" end="00:07:38.080" style="s2">pieces when they learned that someone</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.599" end="00:07:39.919" style="s2">they had loved most in the entire world</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.080" end="00:07:43.039" style="s2">they loved more than anybody in the</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.919" end="00:07:45.840" style="s2">world had spent their final moments in</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.039" end="00:07:50.000" style="s2">excruciating pain and bone chilling</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.840" end="00:07:53.120" style="s2">terror and those families lives will</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.000" end="00:07:55.520" style="s2">never ever be the same. Then after the</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.120" end="00:07:57.840" style="s2">juries delivered their verdicts and the</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.520" end="00:08:00.560" style="s2">justice system returned a muchdeserved</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.840" end="00:08:02.400" style="s2">sentence of death,</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.560" end="00:08:04.400" style="s2">Nuome,</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.400" end="00:08:07.440" style="s2">a terrible governor in so many other</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.400" end="00:08:10.080" style="s2">ways, came along and stole away the only</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.440" end="00:08:12.160" style="s2">closure those families</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.080" end="00:08:14.319" style="s2">might ever have.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.160" end="00:08:17.360" style="s2">He stood with the murderers and the</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.319" end="00:08:20.240" style="s2">child slayers. But today, we say, the</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.360" end="00:08:21.680" style="s2">American people, stand with you. We</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.240" end="00:08:24.960" style="s2">stand with you. We&#39;re not going to let</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.680" end="00:08:30.000" style="s2">this happen.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.960" end="00:08:33.360" style="s2">In May 1996, 8-year-old Michael Lions</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.000" end="00:08:36.399" style="s2">was walking home from elementary school</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.360" end="00:08:39.519" style="s2">in Yuba City, California,</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.399" end="00:08:43.440" style="s2">when he was abducted by convicted sex</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.519" end="00:08:45.760" style="s2">offender Robert Boyd Rhodess, who forced</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.440" end="00:08:49.959" style="s2">young Michael into a secluded area,</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.760" end="00:08:49.959" style="s2">raped and tortured him</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.320" end="00:08:55.519" style="s2">for extended periods of time. The</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.519" end="00:08:59.120" style="s2">predators slashed Michael more than a</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.519" end="00:09:02.080" style="s2">hundred times with a knife and left his</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.120" end="00:09:05.839" style="s2">body on a river bank for others to pick</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.080" end="00:09:08.640" style="s2">up. Roads was captured and sentenced to</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.839" end="00:09:11.040" style="s2">death. But Gavin Newsome thought that</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.640" end="00:09:13.920" style="s2">child killer was owed the mercy that he</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.040" end="00:09:16.320" style="s2">never showed to 8-year-old</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.920" end="00:09:19.200" style="s2">Michael. We&#39;re joined by Michael&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.320" end="00:09:22.000" style="s2">family, including his mother, Sandy. And</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.200" end="00:09:25.399" style="s2">Sandy, I&#39;d like to have you say a few</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.000" end="00:09:25.399" style="s2">words, please.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.560" end="00:09:32.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.720" end="00:09:32.040" style="s2">Thank you, darling.</p>
