<p begin="00:37:50.320" end="00:37:56.800" style="s2">award nearly $150 million to new public</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.560" end="00:37:59.280" style="s2">safety grants to help hire more than</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.800" end="00:38:03.040" style="s2">1,000 additional sworn law enforcement</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.280" end="00:38:05.440" style="s2">officers and speed up response times to</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.040" end="00:38:08.079" style="s2">reports of domestic violence and sexual</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.440" end="00:38:11.320" style="s2">assault nationwide.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.079" end="00:38:11.320" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.960" end="00:38:17.920" style="s2">Thank you very much.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.599" end="00:38:20.400" style="s2">And finally, at my request, Congressman</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.920" end="00:38:22.720" style="s2">Brandon Gil has just introduced a new</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.400" end="00:38:24.880" style="s2">bill to strengthen the death penalty in</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.720" end="00:38:27.440" style="s2">America. And it&#39;s going to be much</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.880" end="00:38:29.280" style="s2">different than it was in the past. Uh</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.440" end="00:38:33.119" style="s2">it&#39;s going to be strong. It&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.280" end="00:38:36.960" style="s2">be swift. The Just Punishment for Murder</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.119" end="00:38:39.200" style="s2">Act will codify many aspects of today&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.960" end="00:38:41.599" style="s2">directive along with my executive order</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.200" end="00:38:43.760" style="s2">on capital punishment for killers of law</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.599" end="00:38:45.920" style="s2">enforcement. and it will expand the</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.760" end="00:38:48.320" style="s2">policy to ensure that illegal alien</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.920" end="00:38:50.880" style="s2">murderers are likewise sentenced to</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.320" end="00:38:52.880" style="s2">death. And I&#39;m calling on Congress to</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.880" end="00:38:54.400" style="s2">send me that bill without delay. And I</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.880" end="00:38:59.079" style="s2">will sign it, Brandon, very, very</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.400" end="00:38:59.079" style="s2">quickly. Okay. Thank you very much.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.160" end="00:39:05.119" style="s2">And the ultimate</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.160" end="00:39:08.160" style="s2">crimes deserve the ultimate punishment.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.119" end="00:39:11.119" style="s2">This age-old wisdom has been a principle</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.160" end="00:39:13.200" style="s2">of virtually every society throughout</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.119" end="00:39:15.440" style="s2">history. at least every successful</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.200" end="00:39:17.440" style="s2">society. And under the Trump</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.440" end="00:39:20.400" style="s2">administration, we are bringing it back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.440" end="00:39:23.200" style="s2">And we will not stop in our pursuit of</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.400" end="00:39:25.280" style="s2">justice. We will not yield. And we just</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.200" end="00:39:28.079" style="s2">won&#39;t yield to the communists, to</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.280" end="00:39:29.920" style="s2">criminals, to horrible people, people</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.079" end="00:39:32.720" style="s2">that want to destroy our country. People</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.920" end="00:39:34.400" style="s2">that really desire to just destroy our</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.720" end="00:39:36.960" style="s2">country.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.400" end="00:39:38.640" style="s2">And I guess they know it. Many of them</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.960" end="00:39:41.040" style="s2">do. We&#39;re not going to let it happen.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.640" end="00:39:43.040" style="s2">will not waver in our commitment to</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.040" end="00:39:45.760" style="s2">these families and we will fight, fight,</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.040" end="00:39:48.560" style="s2">fight and we will make America safer and</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.760" end="00:39:50.160" style="s2">stronger and greater than ever before.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.560" end="00:39:53.359" style="s2">And I want to just thank everybody in</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.160" end="00:39:55.359" style="s2">this audience. You have so many I know</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.359" end="00:39:57.040" style="s2">so many are incredible. These are</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.359" end="00:39:59.520" style="s2">incredible people. You&#39;re the people</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.040" end="00:40:02.160" style="s2">that keep us all safe. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.520" end="00:40:03.839" style="s2">incredible, beautiful people. And I want</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.160" end="00:40:05.680" style="s2">to thank you very much. It&#39;s an honor to</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.839" end="00:40:09.680" style="s2">be your president. Thank you everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.680" end="00:40:09.680" style="s2">God bless you all. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.217" end="00:40:24.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
